<!--
  Every line of interface text. Screens read these with stringResource();
  code below the UI goes through com.kirtan.companion.Strings.

  values-es/ holds the Spanish; Android falls back to this file string by
  string, so a missing translation shows English. Not translated, on
  purpose: the app's name, beat and playlist names, bols, and anything the
  user typed. Names prefixed doing_ are phrases slotted into error
  sentences ("Couldn't reach the server, so %1$s didn't go through").
-->

